  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "On the morning after the Prophet's visit, John Ferrier rode into the city with a letter for Nevada.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 5.26
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He came home to find two strange horses hitched to his own gate posts.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 7.042,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "In his sitting-room sat two young men with their boots up: the sons of Elders Drebber and Stangerson.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 13.542,
      "seconds": 6.5
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Stangerson had four wives, and Drebber seven, and each thought that settled it.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 21.042,
      "seconds": 5.34
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_ferrier",
      "text": "This room has two ways out. The door, or the window.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 27.417,
      "seconds": 5.9
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "They went, and the door banged.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 35.333,
      "seconds": 2.18
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Next morning there was a paper pinned to his coverlet, printed in bold straggling letters.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 38.042,
      "seconds": 6.11
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Twenty-nine days are given you for amendment, it said, and then a dash.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 45.292,
      "seconds": 4.89
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "At breakfast his daughter pointed at the ceiling: scrawled there with a burnt stick, twenty-eight.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 51.292,
      "seconds": 5.44
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Day by day the count came down, on his door and his gate, and no rider was Hope.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 57.833,
      "seconds": 5.44
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The night the figure two went up, with every door bolted, he sank his head on the table.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 64.375,
      "seconds": 5.56
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Then, in the silence, a scratching at a panel of the door; assassin, or the last day's number.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 71.458,
      "seconds": 7.72
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He drew the bolt and threw the door wide on nothing. Then he looked down.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 80.5,
      "seconds": 5.66
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "It writhed over the sill like a snake, sprang up, shut the door, and was Hope the hunter.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 87.667,
      "seconds": 5.8
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jefferson_hope",
      "text": "Food first. Nothing for two days.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 94.5,
      "seconds": 3.32
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "It was Hope, come the last mile on his belly.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 98.52,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He ate like a starving man, and two thousand dollars in gold went into a bag.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 102.75,
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jefferson_hope",
      "text": "The house is watched. So I came in on my belly.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 108.75,
      "seconds": 3.31
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jefferson_hope",
      "text": "Tomorrow is your last day. We ride tonight.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 113.083,
      "seconds": 3.45
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_ferrier",
      "text": "Then we ride tonight. Every acre of it can stay.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 117.542,
      "seconds": 5.76
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Through the side window, one by one, into the garden.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 124.625,
      "seconds": 4.14
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "At the gap Hope dragged them down; nine to seven, said a voice, and seven to five, another.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 129.792,
      "seconds": 6.22
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The horses waited in the Eagle Canyon; high in the pass, a voice rang out above them.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 137.042,
      "seconds": 5.62
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_sentinel",
      "text": "Who goes there? Nine from seven.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 143.667,
      "seconds": 3.25
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jefferson_hope",
      "text": "Travellers for Nevada. Seven from five.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 147.917,
      "seconds": 3.75
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_sentinel",
      "text": "Pass on, then, and the Lord go with you.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 153.167,
      "seconds": 2.87
    }
  ]
}